Package: fax
Title: Facts About the Host, Container and Runtime
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("pedrobtz", , , "pedrobtz@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Reports facts about the operating system, hardware,
    virtualization, containers, 'Kubernetes' pods, 'Azure', and the 'R' and
    'Python' runtimes. Reports the CPU and memory the current process can
    actually use under 'cgroup' limits and CPU affinity, side by side with
    host values, so thread pools and memory budgets can be sized correctly
    inside containers. Also lists installed system, 'R' and 'Python'
    packages, and provides a cheap CPU and memory usage probe for log
    messages. Pure 'R', no network access unless explicitly requested.
